{"id":"a6e71df24b1693f5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-lem-mostowski-col.md","title":"Mostowski Collapse","display":"lem-mostowski-col — Mostowski Collapse","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-mostowski-col","aliases":["58-lem-mostowski-col"],"display":"lem-mostowski-col — Mostowski Collapse","depends_on":["[[58-df-mostowski]]","[[58-df-wellfounded]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-mostowski-col"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-mostowski-col</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-mostowski-col — Mostowski Collapse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b6ec5105268243bd\" href=\"?note=b6ec5105268243bd\" title=\"58-df-mostowski\">58-df-mostowski</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WF}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{WF}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(R\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\pi\\in V\">\\(M,\\pi\\in V\\)</span> (collapse target and collapse map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\)</span> is the well-founded-relation predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\">\\(\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\\)</span> is the exact collapse relation (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6ec5105268243bd\" href=\"?note=b6ec5105268243bd\" title=\"58-df-mostowski\">58-df-mostowski</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}mostowski-col}\\vdash{}&amp;\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\forall z\\in A\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R)]\\to x=y\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!p\\;\\exists M\\;\\exists\\pi\\;\n\\bigl(p=\\langle M,\\pi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}mostowski-col}\\vdash{}&amp;\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\forall z\\in A\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R)]\\to x=y\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!p\\;\\exists M\\;\\exists\\pi\\;\n\\bigl(p=\\langle M,\\pi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every well-founded extensional relation on a set has a unique ordered pair consisting of its transitive collapse and collapse map.</li>\n<li>This constructs transitive models from theories.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-mostowski","status":"resolved","id":"b6ec5105268243bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-mostowski]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wellfounded","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-wellfounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wellfounded","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)$ is the well-founded-relation predicate (see [[58-df-wellfounded]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-mostowski","status":"resolved","id":"b6ec5105268243bd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)$ is the exact collapse relation (see [[58-df-mostowski]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WF}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\pi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}mostowski-col}\\vdash{}&\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{WF}(R,A)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\n[\\forall z\\in A\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in R)]\\to x=y\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists!p\\;\\exists M\\;\\exists\\pi\\;\n\\bigl(p=\\langle M,\\pi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(A,R,M,\\pi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1304,"backlinks":[{"id":"1eb3d35bc0d015a8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3913","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-lem-mostowski-col.md|58-lem-mostowski-col]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["b6ec5105268243bd","7308daa58e0345ed"]}